#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/op/gemm/gemm_fma/index.rst:10
msgid ""
"Used when a tensor-core MMA path is unavailable for the requested dtype, "
"layout, or shape combination (e.g. BF16 on SM70 Volta, or shapes that do not "
"satisfy the SM70 MMA tile constraints). Each thread computes a strided "
"subset of the output tile using ordinary CUDA-core fused multiply-add "
"instructions."
msgstr ""

